        "Optical tracking that scales with size (-2.28px at 76, 0 at 16).",
        "Product props instead of illustrations: a physical fn key, traffic lights, 5px app icons.",
        "Wide canvas, narrow voice: 1280px stage, 576px measure, 96-128px rhythm."
