      "avoid": [
        "Glass on a flat page: without a sky or photograph it reads as a grey box.",
        "System type as a brand: SF on Mac and Segoe on Windows are two different products.",
        "Ambient motion without a prefers-reduced-motion gate.",
        "Platform nouns hard-coded in prose (the live page says 'your Mac' beside a Windows download)."
