  "audit": [
    "Contrast: every text pair >= 4.5:1, every functional boundary >= 3:1. Decorative hairlines are exempt, but label them as decorative in code.",
    "Type: display leading is 1.0-1.25; body leading is >= 1.45. Tracking tightens at display and loosens at small caps.",
    "Radii: one family, no arbitrary values. Pills are for actions and chips only.",
    "Colour: accents are surfaces or signals, never small body text.",
    "Density: the grid is tight or the rhythm is generous. Both at once is noise.",
    "Motion: every transition has a duration and an easing token; no default ease-in-out on layout.",
    "Reduced motion: ambient or looping animation is disabled under prefers-reduced-motion.",
    "Voice: every headline names a standard, a gesture, or a promise. No generic AI adjectives.",
    "Fonts: no proprietary file is self-hosted; each paid family has a named substitute.",
    "Platform: no platform nouns hard-coded in prose."
  ]
}